  "prefLabel": "He-M 315.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2013-10-06",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 315.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to define the rights of members and participants who are receiving peer support services from providers that receive funding from the State of New Hampshire and to establish the responsibilities of peer support agencies (PSA) relative to such rights.\n\nSource. #8445, eff 10-6-05, EXPIRED: 10-6-13\n\nNew. #12191, eff 5-26-17",
